From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IvyCZE <me@ivy.yt>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 06:54:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Embermine: 0009-embermine-wallpapers

Add the Embermine wallpaper collection (bloom, grow, pattern, rise, triangle) above Classic Firefox. The wallpapers are drawn on the device from EmbermineWallpaperData in the current palette: Material You tones when the switch is on, the Nova violet ramp when it is off, and an ember palette below Android 12. Each wallpaper is center-cropped into the portrait, landscape and thumbnail files and re-drawn when its palette fingerprint changes, on startup and on resume. Bloom is the default on new installs. Homepage card text uses the lightest palette tone, and cards use a translucent dark tone. The recent-tab, recent-synced-tab and story cards paint their own title and detail text with that same content color, so none of them keeps the dark surface color on the dark card.

Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

